{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11205120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11205120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1120512001:0":{"text":"帕托你看，你最喜欢的旅人树果！","source_cn":"帕托你看，你最喜欢的旅人树果！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A57B44C01EFB15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120512002:0":{"text":"吼嗷嗷嗷嗷——！","source_cn":"吼嗷嗷嗷嗷——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA1B7BD3D1FFED31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120512003:0":{"text":"唉，完全没用……帕托为什么会突然这么暴躁？叶角熊不是应该比较温顺吗？","source_cn":"唉，完全没用……帕托为什么会突然这么暴躁？叶角熊不是应...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE1C0AEF090DA1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120512004:1":{"text":"等等，这只野兽是叶角熊？！竟然能长到这么大？！","source_cn":"等等，这只野兽是叶角熊？！竟然能长到这么大？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x880384376BE8E141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1120512004":{"text":"等等，这只野兽是叶角熊？！竟然能长到这么大？！","source_cn":"等等，这只野兽是叶角熊？！竟然能长到这么大？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x880384376BE8E141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s