title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120512014:0":{"text":"吼！吼噢噢噢噢——！","source_cn":"吼！吼噢噢噢噢——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A0D43C92D7B118","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120512015:1":{"text":"这……这不能怪我！是拍卖会工作人员教我的驯养方法！","source_cn":"这……这不能怪我！是拍卖会工作人员教我的驯养方法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18F6332DB9CAE619","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120512016:0":{"text":"他们说叶角熊生性凶残，想让它乖乖听话就必须保持饥饿，控制喂食频率，来强化它的忠诚。","source_cn":"他们说叶角熊生性凶残，想让它乖乖听话就必须保持饥饿，控...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x399ABCDAD674EBC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120512017:0":{"text":"还说不能喂食太多，否则它会胖得连路都走不了。我……我哪知道它一直没吃饱啊？！","source_cn":"还说不能喂食太多，否则它会胖得连路都走不了。我……我哪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE48E51A9276C4E3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1120512017":{"text":"还说不能喂食太多，否则它会胖得连路都走不了。我……我哪知道它一直没吃饱啊？！","source_cn":"还说不能喂食太多，否则它会胖得连路都走不了。我……我哪知道它一直没吃饱啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE48E51A9276C4E3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title